%Y A001197 Cf. (n X n+1) A006620 (K_{2,2}), A006617 (K_{2,3}), A006618 (K_{2,4}), A006621 (K_{3,3}), A006622 (K_{3,4}), A006626 (K_{4,4}).
%Y A001197 Cf. (n X n+2) A006619 (K_{2,4}), A006618 (K_{2,4}), A006625 (K_{3,4}).
%Y A001197 Cf. (n X n-1) A006623 (K_{2,3}).
%Y A001197 Cf. (n X n+3) A006624 (K_{2,4}).
